{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33052","headline":"续幽愤 · 曹邺","name":"续幽愤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"繁霜作阴起，朱火乘夕发。\n清昼冷无光，兰膏坐销歇。\n惟公执天宪，身是台中杰。\n一逐楚大夫，何人爲君雪。\n怱怱鬼方路，不许辞双阙。\n过门似他乡，举趾如遗辙。\n八月黄草生，洪涛入云热。\n危魂没太行，客吊空骨节。\n千年瘴江水，恨声流不绝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33052.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33052","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}